# Unit10
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2024红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 基础词Unit10核心词汇

consist/kənˈsɪst/由…组成/The team consists of ten members.
constant/ˈkɑːnstənt/持续的；不变的/He drives at a constant speed.
construct/kənˈstrʌkt/建造；构建/They plan to construct a new bridge.
consult/kənˈsʌlt/咨询；查阅/You should consult a doctor about your health.
consume/kənˈsuːm/消耗；消费/The car consumes too much fuel.
contact/ˈkɑːntækt/接触；联系/Please contact me if you have any questions.
contain/kənˈteɪn/包含；容纳/This box contains all the documents.
content/ˈkɑːntent/内容；满足的/She was content with her simple life.
contest/ˈkɑːntest/比赛；竞争/She won first prize in the speech contest.
context/ˈkɑːntekst/上下文；背景/You need to understand the context of the word.
continue/kənˈtɪnjuː/继续/The rain continued for three days.
contract/ˈkɑːntrækt/合同/They signed a contract with the company.
contrary/ˈkɑːntreri/相反的/On the contrary, I think it's a great idea.
contrast/ˈkɑːntræst/对比；反差/The contrast between the two paintings is striking.
contribute/kənˈtrɪbjuːt/贡献；投稿/She contributed a lot to the research project.
control/kənˈtroʊl/控制/The situation is under control now.
convince/kənˈvɪns/说服；使确信/She convinced him to change his mind.
cooperate/koʊˈɑːpəreɪt/合作/We need to cooperate with each other to finish the task.
cope/koʊp/应对；处理/She learned to cope with stress effectively.
core/kɔːr/核心；果心/Hard work is the core of success.
corner/ˈkɔːrnər/角落/The store is on the corner of the street.
correct/kəˈrekt/正确的；纠正/Your answer is correct.
correspond/ˌkɔːrəˈspɑːnd/通信；对应/The data corresponds with our predictions.
cost/kɒst/成本；花费/The cost of living has increased significantly.
cottage/ˈkɑːtɪdʒ/小屋/They spent the weekend in a cottage by the lake.
cotton/ˈkɑːtn/棉花/Cotton is soft and comfortable to wear.
council/ˈkaʊnsl/委员会；议会/The city council approved the new policy.
count/kaʊnt/计算；重要/Every vote counts in an election.
country/ˈkʌntri/国家；乡村/China is a vast country with a long history.
countryside/ˈkʌntrisaɪd/农村；乡下/They moved to the countryside for a quieter life.
county/ˈkaʊnti/县/This county has a population of 500,000.
couple/ˈkʌpl/一对；夫妇/The couple celebrated their anniversary.
courage/ˈkɜːrɪdʒ/勇气/It takes courage to stand up for what is right.
course/kɔːrs/课程；过程/She enrolled in a computer science course.
court/kɔːrt/法庭；球场/The case will be heard in court next week.
cousin/ˈkʌzn/表亲/My cousin lives in Shanghai.
cover/ˈkʌvər/覆盖；封面/The snow covered the entire field.
crack/kræk/裂缝；破裂/There is a crack in the wall.
craft/kræft/工艺；手艺/She learned the craft of pottery making.
crash/kræʃ/碰撞；坠毁/The plane crashed into the mountain.
crazy/ˈkreɪzi/疯狂的/That's a crazy idea, but it might work.
cream/kriːm/奶油；乳霜/She put cream in her coffee.
create/kriˈeɪt/创造/Artists create beautiful works of art.
creature/ˈkriːtʃər/生物/The ocean is full of strange creatures.
credit/ˈkredɪt/信用；学分/He deserves credit for his hard work.
crew/kruː/全体船员/The crew worked together to sail the ship.
crime/kraɪm/犯罪/Crime rates have decreased in recent years.
crisis/ˈkraɪsɪs/危机/The country is facing an economic crisis.
critic/ˈkrɪtɪk/批评家/The critic gave the film a positive review.
critical/ˈkrɪtɪkl/批评的；关键的/This is a critical moment in our history.
